<h1>MailDigest</h1>
<p class="sub">Version @VERSION@ · MIT licence ·
<a href="https://github.com/kpafi/maildigest">Source on GitHub</a></p>
<nav>
  <a href="#install">Install</a>
  <a href="#example">Example</a>
